      "statement": "ApiAddressContext defaults the backend address to https://rest.ardoco.de, hydrates it from the localStorage key 'apiAddress' on mount, and setApiAddress normalizes the input (strips any /api/ suffix and trailing slash), probes it via GET /api/health through the middleware, and only persists to localStorage and applies the address when the probe succeeds.",
