      "statement": "ProjectUploadContext owns the wizard form state (projectName, selectedTraceLinkType, files, errors, traceLinkConfiguration, findInconsistencies); FormProvider takes an allowedFileTypes prop from the route and fetches /api/configuration with X-Target-API whenever it runs with an apiAddress, exposing configurationLoading/configurationError plus originalTraceLinkConfiguration, and updateFormData automatically resets findInconsistencies to false whenever the resulting selected type is not SAD_SAM.",
